  "text": "In June 2021, we returned most often to our leadership. Eight of us said \"republican leader kevin\" and eight \"leader kevin mccarthy,\" each peaking on June 30; seven of us paired them as \"republican leader kevin mccarthy.\" Seven reached for \"military force aumf\" and six for \"use of military force aumf,\" both peaking June 17. Six of us said \"our southern border,\" and six \"the southern border,\" peaking June 23 and June 30. Six said \"look forward to working with,\" peaking June 29. Where the record names a first appearance, it does so across the whole ledger: \"republican leader kevin\" under Michael Guest, \"military force aumf\" under John Garamendi, \"look forward to working with\" under André Carson. This is what we repeated in this era, and how many of us repeated each thing. We report it as we said it.",
